From cec70a1509215d6528608534125e86054c079f34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MicroNUX Project <micronux@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 04:47:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] mmc: dw: report ESP32-P4 descriptor size

Include the controller-specific descriptor size in its boot-time diagnostic.

Signed-off-by: MicroNUX Project <micronux@example.invalid>
---
 drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/dw_mmc.c
@@ -3187,1 +3187,1 @@ static int dw_mci_init_slot(struct dw_mci *host)
-			 "ESP32-P4 IDMAC internal-SRAM bounce: 4 KiB requests\n");
+			 "ESP32-P4 IDMAC internal-SRAM bounce: 4 KiB requests, 64-byte descriptors\n");
-- 
